Revision: 2d3e9b53b0ebc44c6da6901ff242a95edaa4a1ff
The upstream MIT/X Consortium license is preserved in LICENSE.

tests/fixtures/fonts/SourceCodePro-Regular.ttf is copied unchanged from the pinned
ned resources for development tests only. Source Code Pro is by Adobe; its SIL
Open Font License is preserved in tests/fixtures/fonts/SourceCodePro-LICENSE.md.

Additional copied fonts and artwork retain their original notices and licenses
in resources/fonts/ATTRIBUTION.txt and resources/icons/ATTRIBUTION.txt.
Tree-sitter runtime and grammar providers use published Cargo packages. Release
packages retain their licenses under LICENSES/dependencies/cargo/; original
highlight query attribution remains in resources/queries and the source history.
Grammar notices omitted from published archives are retained unchanged in
LICENSES/tree-sitter-NOTICES.txt. Their exact release revisions, source URLs
and checksums are recorded in LICENSES/tree-sitter-sources.json.

